{
 "duration": 25.149,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "On the steep way down, Kara's pack swung side to side with every step.",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 4.352
  },
  {
   "text": "Her water bottle thumped her back, and she kept losing her balance.",
   "start": 4.652,
   "end": 8.248
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's the fix. Pack heavy things like water and food close to your back, light things outside.",
   "start": 8.598,
   "end": 14.142
  },
  {
   "text": "Then clip the chest strap and the waist strap, and pull the shoulder straps snug.",
   "start": 14.442,
   "end": 18.521
  },
  {
   "text": "Now the pack moves with you.",
   "start": 18.821,
   "end": 20.227
  },
  {
   "text": "Kara's next descent felt steady and quick.",
   "start": 20.577,
   "end": 22.679
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this before your next steep hike.",
   "start": 23.079,
   "end": 24.949
  }
 ],
